 /cogwheel0/conduit/pull/807\n* Make everyday Open WebUI features available
  without Advanced and polish the new screens by @cogwheel0 in https://gith
 ub.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/808\n* CI: run steps in parallel\, cache Gra
 dle\, and trim setup by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit
 /pull/810\n* Add Flutter control facades and a narrow platform UI vocabula
 ry (1/5) by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/811\n*
  Enforce the platform UI seam with a shrinking allow-list (2/5) by @cogwhe
 el0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/812\n* Route settings sel
 ection controls through platform UI (3/5) by @cogwheel0 in https://github.
 com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/813\n* Use platform UI chips for reactions\, de
 cisions and folder icons (4/5) by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwhee
 l0/conduit/pull/814\n* Use platform UI controls for launcher loading and D
 irect retries (5/5) by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/
 pull/815\n* Keep the chosen reasoning effort when the model selector is re
 opened by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/821\n* S
 tore Open WebUI servers and accounts in one registry (1/4) by @cogwheel0 i
 n https://github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/817\n* Keep several Open WebUI
  accounts signed in and switch between them (2/4) by @cogwheel0 in https:/
 /github.com/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/818\n* Switch\, add and sign out of Ope
 n WebUI accounts from the profile (3/4) by @cogwheel0 in https://github.co
 m/cogwheel0/conduit/pull/819\n* Reach an Open WebUI server through whichev
 er of its addresses answers (4/4) by @cogwheel0 in https://github.com/cogw
